2088,imgsize-70198.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Unjust Iranian aggression': Kuwait's ministries complex building targeted in 'hostile' drone attack; watch]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130031063.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kuwait's ministries complex and Shuwaikh oil sector were hit by a hostile drone attack on Sunday, which the finance ministry attributed to "unjust Iranian aggression." While significant material damage was reported, authorities confirmed no casualties. Kuwaiti air defenses intercepted incoming threats as part of Iran's ongoing offensive across the Gulf.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/unjust-iranian-aggression-kuwaits-ministries-complex-building-targeted-in-hostile-drone-attack-watch/articleshow/130031063.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/unjust-iranian-aggression-kuwaits-ministries-complex-building-targeted-in-hostile-drone-attack-watch/articleshow/130031063.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-05T06:50:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130031306,imgsize-494716.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Drone strike hits Iraq oil facilities; Iran-backed group claims 19 attacks on US bases]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130011222.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-israel-iran-war-news-live-updates-middle-east-crisis-conflict-latest-news-iran-drone-missile-attack-gulf-dubai-qatar-news-strait-of-hormuz-crude-oil-impact-donald-trump/liveblog/130011222.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/wo