us/marco-rubio-revokes-green-cards-of-2-relatives-of-slain-iranian-commander-hands-them-to-ice-for-deportation/articleshow/130025579.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marco-rubio-revokes-green-cards-of-2-relatives-of-slain-iranian-commander-hands-them-to-ice-for-deportation/articleshow/130025579.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-05T00:46:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130025579,imgsize-113532.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Titanic returns, this time in the sky: 950 drones recreate the iconic liner in a stunning show over UK’s Belfast]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130025859.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A spectacular drone show lit up Belfast's night sky, forming the outline of the historic RMS Titanic.  Around 950 drones created the glowing silhouette over Belfast Harbour.  The event marked the anniversary of Titanic's departure from the city's shipyards in 1912.  This modern tribute blended history and technology, reminding viewers of the ship's enduring legacy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/titanic-returns-this-time-in-the-sky-950-drones-recreate-the-iconic-liner-in-a-stunning-show-over-uks-belfast/articleshow/130025859.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/titanic-returns-this-time-in-the-sky-950-drones-recreate-the-iconic-liner-in-a-stunning-show-over-uks-belfast/articleshow/130025859.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-05T00:23:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130025909,imgsize-697903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch streamer Emiru shares shocking middle school bullying moment as livestream with Cinna takes an unexpected emotional turn]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130023691.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Emiru opened up about being bullied in school during a livestream with Cinna on April 3, 2026. She shared painful memories, including a hurtful comment about her appearance and teasing about her ears. Cinna also shared her own story. The conversation mixed emotion with light moments, giving viewers a real look into their past experiences.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-emiru-shares-shocking-middle-school-bullying-moment-as-livestream-with-cinna-takes-an-unexpected-emotional-turn/articleshow/130023691.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-emiru-shares-shocking-middle-school-bullying-moment-as-livestream-with-cinna-takes-an-unexpected-emotional-turn/articleshow/130023691.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T22:27:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130023599,imgsize-21756.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sam Pepper faces animal abuse claims after livestream clip with pet squirrel Potato draws heavy backlash online]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130024550.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sam Pepper is facing backlash after a livestream clip showed him grabbing and shouting at his pet squirrel, Potato. The video, shared on Reddit, led to many accusing him of animal abuse. Pepper responded by calling it discipline and denied wrongdoing. The situation has sparked debate online, with his past controversies also being brought up again.]]></descrip