erfectly for fitness]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130021977.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Retirees in Singapore are embracing adapted "geriatric parkour" to boost strength, balance, and confidence. These sessions focus on controlled, functional movements in urban spaces, helping seniors navigate daily life with renewed independence and energy. The trend reflects Singapore's aging population and promotes active aging by reducing fall risks and enhancing mobility.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapores-ageing-population-is-turning-to-parkour-and-its-working-perfectly-for-fitness/articleshow/130021977.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapores-ageing-population-is-turning-to-parkour-and-its-working-perfectly-for-fitness/articleshow/130021977.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T20:30:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130022016,imgsize-1009772.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘I’m not suicidal’: US congressman says UFO secrets he knows could keep Americans ‘up at night’ and ‘country unglued’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130020006.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Rep. Tim Burchett says classified UFO briefings contain information so disturbing it could “set the country unglued” and keep people “up at night.” Though he claims to have been briefed by multiple agencies, he refuses to share details, citing potential risks. He continues to push for full disclosure while warning the public may not be prepared.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-not-suicidal-us-congressman-says-ufo-secrets-he-knows-could-keep-americans-up-at-night-and-the-country-unglued/articleshow/130020006.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-not-suicidal-us-congressman-says-ufo-secrets-he-knows-could-keep-americans-up-at-night-and-the-country-unglued/articleshow/130020006.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T19:21:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130020949,imgsize-1116194.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump considering firing FBI director Kash Patel according to White House officials]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130020593.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-considering-firing-fbi-director-kash-patel-according-to-white-house-officials-report/articleshow/130020593.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-considering-firing-fbi-director-kash-patel-according-to-white-house-officials-report/articleshow/130020593.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T19:06:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130020593,imgsize-113940.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Rini Sampath: Indian-born candidate becomes first South Asian to enter Washington DC mayoral race]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130018977.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-rini-sampath-indian-born-candidate-becomes-first-south-asian-to-enter-washington-dc-mayoral-race/articleshow/130018977.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-rini-sampath-indian-born-candidate-becomes-first-south-asian-to-enter-washington-dc-mayoral-race/articleshow/130018977.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T18:23:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130018977,imgsize-54300.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indonesia receives bodies of peacekeepers killed in Lebanon]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130019648.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Indonesia received the bodies of three peacekeeprs Saturday that were killed on deployment in Lebanon as it branded an explosion that injured three other of its blue helmets as "unacceptable". The bodies of the three men arrived in Jakarta on Saturday.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indonesia-receives-bodies-of-peacekeepers-killed-in-lebanon/articleshow/130019648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indonesia-receives-bodies-of-peacekeepers-killed-in-lebanon/articleshow/130019648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-04T18:15:27+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130019767,imgsize-511568.cms"/></item></channel></rss>